             GetCloudDefinition() and its result value cache has been removed.
             All configuration related values required by Update Service may be parsed from cloud parameters.
             We store as XMLElement object to reduce XML parsing.
             */
             var cloudParamsCacheSettings = CacheSettings.GetCacheSettings<CloudParametersXml>(configDict);
